  "description": "Describe a network protocol once (framing, messages, state machine, limits, lifecycle) and run it over any Stream or IDuplexPipe. Built on System.IO.Pipelines: zero-copy parsing, allocation-free steady state, protocol switching, typed sessions consumed with await foreach.",
