  "releaseNotes": "The first preview: protocol description with build-time validation and a definition linter; framing, message sets and Wire serialization; connections over Stream, stream pairs and IDuplexPipe; sessions read with await foreach, protocol switching, payload streaming; timeouts, minimum data rates, buffer and drain limits, a budget for automatic replies; pooled, stamped messages that refuse use after their lifetime.",
